                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "KyleHsieh.Quanta",
                        "email": "Kyle.Hsieh@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "KyleHsieh171"
                    },
                    "message": "We primarily update CFG0 due to CFG1 is designated as the Golden Image for failsafe and is intentionally kept stable. CFG1 is only triggered as a backup in the event of a boot failure or recovery scenario."
